    "profileText": "a Representative from Texas; born in California, April 18, 1988; attended Klein Forest High School, Klein, Tex.; graduated from Alief Hastings High School, Houston, Tex., 2006; B.B.A, University of Texas, San Antonio, Tex., 2010; J.D., Washington University School of Law, St. Louis, Mo., 2013; lawyer, private practice; county attorney, Harris County, Tex., 2021-2025; acting county attorney, Harris County, Tex., 2025; elected as a Democrat to the One Hundred Nineteenth Congress, by special election, to fill the vacancy caused by the death of United States Representative Sylvester Turner (January 31, 2026-present).",
